ch Phys Med Rehab</source><year>1989</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>510</fpage><lpage>517</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goldie</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>OM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bach</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Steadiness in one-legged stance: development of a reliable force-platform testing procedure</article-title><source>Arch Phys Med Rehab</source><year>1992</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>348</fpage><lpage>354</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0003-9993(92)90008-K</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perrin</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name><name><surname>Bene</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Durupt</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ankle trauma significantly impairs posture-a study in basketball players and controls</article-title><source>Int J Sports Med</source><year>1997</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>392</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9298781</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1055/s-2007-972651</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lephart</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Pincivero</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rozzi</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proprioception of the ankle and knee</article-title><source>Sports Med</source><year>1998</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>155</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9554026</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2165/00007256-199825030-00002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-